# endpoints
- POST /api/conversations → create new conversation

- POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages → send user message & get reply from chosen model

- POST /api/conversations/{id}/switch → switch model mid-thread

- GET /api/models → list available models


# Connectors we’ll implement now:

- DeepSeekConnector → OpenAI-compatible

- GeminiConnector → Google API call

- MockConnector → (useful for testing without hitting APIs)